WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.250 line:88% position:50% align:middle size:84%
Great service does not always become a public review.

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:07.000 line:88% position:50% align:middle size:84%
The gap is usually follow-through.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.400 line:88% position:50% align:middle size:84%
Customers get busy, and your team cannot chase everyone manually.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:18.300 line:88% position:50% align:middle size:84%
Get Phame gives small businesses an individual,
compliance-aware outreach workflow.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:24.600 line:88% position:50% align:middle size:84%
Add one customer at a time so every request stays personal,
not a bulk campaign.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:29.750 line:88% position:50% align:middle size:84%
Send from your connected inbox,
so customers recognize who is asking.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:35.150 line:88% position:50% align:middle size:84%
If there is no response, Get Phame schedules
a limited follow-up sequence.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.750 line:88% position:50% align:middle size:84%
When the requested action is completed,
future reminders stop automatically.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:48.000 line:88% position:50% align:middle size:84%
That balance is intentional: consistent enough to reduce missed opportunities,
controlled enough to respect the customer.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:54.250 line:88% position:50% align:middle size:84%
Your dashboard keeps the process visible
without turning review outreach into another daily task.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:58.500 line:88% position:50% align:middle size:84%
See how it works and start at getphame.app.
